# COSMOQ Integration Page Extraction

**URL**: `https://cosmoq.framer.website/integration`

---

## Page Structure

```
├── Navigation
├── Hero Section
├── Integration Categories (Tabs)
├── Integration Logos Grid
├── Footer CTA
└── Footer
```

---

## Section 1: Hero

### Content
- **H1**: "Freedom to choose your integrations"
- **Description**: "Connect any app or system pre-built or custom with ease and flexibility."

---

## Section 2: Integration Categories

### Filter Tabs
- Cloud providers
- AI Models
- CRM
- IT Service

### Integration Display
- Logo grid showing integrations per category
- Hover effect: grayscale to color
- Click to view integration details

---

## Layout CSS

```css
.integration-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
  gap: 32px;
}

.integration-logo {
  filter: grayscale(100%);
  opacity: 0.7;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

.integration-logo:hover {
  filter: grayscale(0%);
  opacity: 1;
}
```

---

## Animation
- Tab switching: Fade crossfade
- Logo entrance: Staggered fade in
